  TestName: returnsEmptyMaybeWhenReplayModeIsOff
  Description: Validate that beforeRunCallback returns an empty Maybe if the session state does not have the replay config enabled, effectively skipping any replay logic and not calling loadInvocationState.

Execution:
  Arrange: Create a mock InvocationContext where session().state() is an empty map or missing the "_adk_replay_config" key.
  Act: Call beforeRunCallback with this InvocationContext.
  Assert: Assert that the returned Maybe is empty.

Validation: 
